scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"sell-with-woocommerce-a-3d-view-on-every-product\">Sell with WooCommerce: a 3D view on every product<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#sell-with-woocommerce-a-3d-view-on-every-product\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>Give each WooCommerce product its Verse scene. Shoppers get a <strong>3D view</strong> tab on the product page, or the 3D in place of the image gallery. The poster paints first; the 3D loads when the shopper scrolls to it.</p>\n<p><strong>Status:</strong> plugin code validated locally (PHP parsed, zip built: <code>node integrations/embeds/check.mjs</code>). Not yet run on a live WooCommerce store.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-install-the-verse-plugin\">1. Install the Verse plugin<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#1-install-the-verse-plugin\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The same <strong>Verse</strong> plugin as for WordPress pages (<a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere\">Embed anywhere</a>), version 1.1.0 or later: <strong>Plugins → Add New → Upload Plugin</strong> → <code>verse-embed-1.1.0.zip</code> → Activate. With WooCommerce active, the plugin adds its product features on its own.</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-put-a-scene-on-a-product\">2. Put a scene on a product<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#2-put-a-scene-on-a-product\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Products → edit the product → <strong>Product data → Verse 3D</strong>:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Scene link</strong>: paste the share link from Studio (<code>https://verse.ctruh.com/?vpk=ingest/&lt;scene-id&gt;.vpk</code>). A private scene&#39;s link carries its share token (Studio → Embed → <em>Create an embed share link</em>).</li><li><strong>Replace the image gallery</strong>: tick it to show the 3D where the product photos go, for this product only.</li></ul>\n<p>Update the product. Its page now has a <strong>3D view</strong> tab next to Description.</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-store-wide-settings\">3. Store-wide settings<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#3-store-wide-settings\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<p>WooCommerce → Settings → Products → <strong>Verse 3D</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Setting</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Replace the image gallery</td><td>On every product with a scene, the 3D view takes the gallery&#39;s place (the tab stays)</td></tr><tr><td>Shape</td><td>Square (default, products), 16:9, 4:3, 3:4, 9:16, 21:9</td></tr><tr><td>Load the 3D</td><td>When the shopper scrolls to it, or on tap only</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"4-anywhere-else-the-shortcode\">4. Anywhere else: the shortcode<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#4-anywhere-else-the-shortcode\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<p><code>[verse_product]</code> on a product page shows that product&#39;s scene. <code>[verse_product id=&quot;123&quot; aspect=&quot;1:1&quot; width=&quot;640&quot; load=&quot;tap&quot;]</code> shows product 123&#39;s scene in any post or page.</p>\n<h2 id=\"headless-stores\">Headless stores<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#headless-stores\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The link is on the REST API for storefronts that do not render WordPress pages:</p>\n<ul><li><code>GET /wp-json/wc/v3/products/123</code> → <code>verse_scene_url</code> and <code>verse_embed_url</code> (the lazy embed card to frame).</li><li>Store API <code>GET /wp-json/wc/store/v1/products/123</code> → <code>extensions.verse.scene_url</code> / <code>embed_url</code>.</li><li><code>GET /wp-json/wp/v2/product/123</code> → <code>meta._verse_scene_url</code> (writable with edit rights).</li></ul>\n<p>Frame <code>embed_url</code> in an iframe, or pass <code>scene_url</code> to <code>&lt;verse-viewer src=&quot;…&quot;&gt;</code> (<code>https://verse.ctruh.com/sdk/verse-viewer.js</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-shoppers-get\">What shoppers get<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-shoppers-get\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The same embed card as everywhere: poster first, the 3D on view (or tap), a fullscreen button, the page still scrolling on phones. Views count under <em>Arrived via: embed</em> on the scene&#39;s <a href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-analytics-page\">analytics page</a>.</p>\n<p>More: <code>integrations/embeds/wordpress/README.md</code>.</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#1-install-the-verse-plugin\" id=\"lnk-1-install-the-verse-plugin\">1. Install the Verse plugin</a><a href=\"#2-put-a-scene-on-a-product\" id=\"lnk-2-put-a-scene-on-a-product\">2. Put a scene on a product</a><a href=\"#3-store-wide-settings\" id=\"lnk-3-store-wide-settings\">3. Store-wide settings</a><a href=\"#4-anywhere-else-the-shortcode\" id=\"lnk-4-anywhere-else-the-shortcode\">4. Anywhere else: the shortcode</a><a href=\"#headless-stores\" id=\"lnk-headless-stores\">Headless stores</a><a href=\"#what-shoppers-get\" id=\"lnk-what-shoppers-get\">What shoppers get</a></aside></section>"}